  "call": {
    "name": "Semi-annual panel allocation",
    "description": "Modelled on the ACCESS Maximize project type: the largest allocations, requested twice a year with one request per project per round, for a fixed twelve months. Proposals are evaluated together after each cut-off: an eligibility check, a technical assessment by each requested resource provider alongside merit reviews by the panel's reviewers, and the panel meeting, before the call managers decide and the applicant accepts the award. Supplements and extensions go through the extension request.",
